Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 23:49:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] feat(word): Word-like alignment guides while dragging an
 object

The guides drawn when a dragged object snaps were light grey dashed
lines across the whole view. Draw them like Word's alignment guides:
solid green lines across the page only. Also snap to the top of the
first line of the body paragraphs of the page, as Word's paragraph
alignment guides do, in addition to the margins, the page centre and
the other objects.

[upstreamable]

Assisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
